🕵️ Final Field Notes for the Breach:
The First Reboot: Don't panic if the school PC takes a minute to recognize the USB. Just keep tapping that F12/F11 key.
The Command Line: When you run the mv commands in Kali, remember that Utilman.exe is capitalized in Windows. Linux is picky—if it says "File not found," check your spelling.
The Silent Dev: Once you're in that Admin account, the first thing you do is get Luna.js synced. Use that high-speed lab connection to your advantage.